{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Create a SEND access fund within the Every Child Can enrichment programme",
        "additional_details": "This petition is about funding the 1:1/1:2 additional adult support and reasonable adjustments many SEND children need to access activities they love all year-round (not just in holidays).\r\nIf a child needs 1:1 support Activity Providers are often faced with a hard choice:\r\nThey absorb costs,\r\nAsk parents to stay,\r\nOr turn a child away.\r\nWe believe that Every Child Can should mean every child actually can.\r\n",
        "background": "We call on the Government to create a dedicated SEND access support fund within Every Child Can & related enrichment programmes. This fund should be available to eligible community organisations & children\u2019s activity providers when a child with SEND needs additional adult support to participate.",
